视觉表现能力，能独立高质量完成大型项目。\n2.逻辑思维严谨，能够准确把控需求和解决思路，严谨有序地推导出有效设计方案，把设计做正确。\n3. 具备用户研究和数据分析能力，较好的同理心，深刻理解用户心理和行为，在项目中提供用户视角下的决策观点。\n4. 具备工匠精神，对设计抱有极大热情，打磨并提升产品的设计细节，关注产品设计流行趋势。\n5. 有良好的沟通协作能力，积极参与团队内部和上下游的沟通，更多作为问题的解决者。","ClassificationOne":"设计类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-09T16:40:16","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"dc6707e8-1c2b-4cb1-8bde-b2ce658cc947","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511228248,"PostDateInt":1794209202000,"PostDate":"2026-11-09T15:26:42","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"用户服务策略运营-四轮租车(J21842)","OrgId":700102446,"Org":"用户服务","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责租车门店服务全流程策略的设计、迭代与落地，涵盖服务触点优化、响应时效提升、用户满意度驱动机制建设等；\n2. 基于租车用户行为数据与服务运营指标（如复购、客诉、差评、N