ry":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责车辆上架目标：对C2C与门店代管车辆月度上架量负责，负责全国区域城市的目标拆解和达成。\n2. 负责提升外呼效率：负责外呼人员的招聘、培训、排班和日常管理，带队跑通从线索到上架的全链路转化。\n3. 负责提效率/建SOP：梳理车辆招募、上架审核、代管签约的全流程；推动AI效率工具落地，提升自助上架率和外呼上架转化率。\n4. 负责车辆供给质量：定上架车辆准入标准（车龄、车况、车型），审核上架车辆，Own在租车辆车况相关指标。\n5. 负责车主留存与满意度：细化车主分层，分层重点运营；跟进车主留存率、复租率、好评率和客诉，服务满意度不达标要闭环改进。\n6. 长期负责供给服务质量与价格：监控取还车准时、清洁、响应速度等服务指标；结合日租金指导价体系管价格合理性，淡旺季调价有依据不乱价。","Require":"1. 3年以上供给招募和供给管理经验，带过5人以上团队；有租车行业、车队管理、民宿房源拓展等背景优先。\n2. 有成熟的交流沟通能力，问题拆解落地能力，搭过SOP、做过绩效方案，能看转化漏斗、会用数据说话。\n3. 强结果导向，能抗压，能接受初创业务的目标压力。\n4. 加分：熟悉二手车、租车市场；有车主社群或商户运营经验。","ClassificationOne":"线上运营","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-09T14:13:24","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"2429129c-8e55-4645-8fbe-d2