 a.搭建团队考核机制，拆解目标，建立可追踪，数据化的工作管理机制。\n    b.搭建和优化团队结构，保证团队内部高效扭转；","Require":"-本科及以上学历，市场营销、广告、传播、新闻相关专业优先。\n-6年以上社交媒体/数字营销相关工作经验，其中至少3年团队管理经验(岗位含经理/主管/Leader/总监，或明确带教团队成员)。\n-英文可作为工作语言，能对接国际品牌客户。\n能力要求：具备成熟的Social内容判断力与策略能力，能独立完成从洞察到方案到落地的全链路输出。-有多品牌、多项目并行管理的实操经验，抗压能力强，能同时平衡质量、成本与时效。拥有丰富的公关资源:媒体、KOL、明星、公关公司人脉，且具备资源议价与效果评估能力。-具备方案策划与商务拓展(BD)能力，有具体可验证的拓客/比稿成功案例。\n-有女性产品，电子消费品，beatuy tech相关内容营销爆品经验优先；","ClassificationOne":"线上运营","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-19T17:44:02","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"7b850452-ed0c-4de9-a810-975bfab0e019","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511221842,"PostDateInt":1792389644000,"PostDate":"2026-10-19T14:00:44","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件工程师-A项目(J21789)","OrgId":3872919,"Org":"